KUBERNETES CLUSTER VALIDATOR (read-only)

Run:     cluster-validator --mode one-time
Upgrade: cluster-validator --mode post-upgrade
Help:    cluster-validator --help
Docs:    /usr/share/cluster-validator/README.md
Runbook: /usr/share/cluster-validator/RUNBOOK.md

Exit 0 = ready, 1 = not-ready, 2 = usage/configuration error.
Report: cluster-validator.telekom.com/v1alpha1. No remediation is performed.
